torch 2.11.0+cu128
transformers 5.13.1
accelerate 1.14.0
# of gpus:  1
usage: main.py [-h] [--model MODEL] [--model_type MODEL_TYPE] [--seed SEED]
               [--nsamples NSAMPLES] [--eval_dataset {wikitext2,c4,ptb}]
               [--sparsity_ratio SPARSITY_RATIO]
               [--sparsity_type {unstructured,4:8,2:4}]
               [--prune_method {wanda,sparsegpt,magnitude,DSnoT,dense}]
               [--initial_method {wanda,sparsegpt,magnitude}]
               [--max_cycle_time MAX_CYCLE_TIME] [--without_DSnoT]
               [--update_threshold UPDATE_THRESHOLD]
               [--pow_of_var_regrowing POW_OF_VAR_REGROWING]
               [--pow_of_var_pruning POW_OF_VAR_PRUNING]
               [--skip_layer {no_skip,mlp,self_attn}]
               [--skip_sub_layer {no_skip,q_proj,k_proj,v_proj,o_proj,gate_proj,down_proj,up_proj,fc1,fc2,out_proj}]
               [--without_same_sign {True,False}] [--get_time_overhead]
               [--output_results_file OUTPUT_RESULTS_FILE]
               [--cache_dir CACHE_DIR] [--save_model SAVE_MODEL]

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --model MODEL         LLaMA model
  --model_type MODEL_TYPE
                        model type, either llama or opt
  --seed SEED           Seed for sampling the calibration data.
  --nsamples NSAMPLES   Number of calibration samples.
  --eval_dataset {wikitext2,c4,ptb}
                        eval ppl on dataset
  --sparsity_ratio SPARSITY_RATIO
                        Sparsity ratio.
  --sparsity_type {unstructured,4:8,2:4}
  --prune_method {wanda,sparsegpt,magnitude,DSnoT,dense}
  --initial_method {wanda,sparsegpt,magnitude}
  --max_cycle_time MAX_CYCLE_TIME
                        Max cycle time.
  --without_DSnoT       without DSnoT
  --update_threshold UPDATE_THRESHOLD
                        update threshold.
  --pow_of_var_regrowing POW_OF_VAR_REGROWING
                        The power of variance.
  --pow_of_var_pruning POW_OF_VAR_PRUNING
                        The power of variance.
  --skip_layer {no_skip,mlp,self_attn}
  --skip_sub_layer {no_skip,q_proj,k_proj,v_proj,o_proj,gate_proj,down_proj,up_proj,fc1,fc2,out_proj}
  --without_same_sign {True,False}
                        without same sign
  --get_time_overhead   get time overhead
  --output_results_file OUTPUT_RESULTS_FILE
  --cache_dir CACHE_DIR
  --save_model SAVE_MODEL
                        Path to save the pruned model.
